          "checked_on": "2026-11-11",
          "binding": "should",
          "value": 3,
          "unit": "seconds",
          "text": "Should be at least 3 seconds. The iOS page says the same (https://developers.facebook.com/docs/ios/sharing-to-reels-instagram/, updated 2026-04-06). should is not a reject line."
